;; The director seat: films a proposed org_plan's first week on a clone
;; and hands in the film and its take report. It decides nothing: the
;; engine's film pass judges the take and lands it. Epic cafa6106,
;; ticket e552de65. The scene it plays is the plan's first_week_scene,
;; which the audit renders for each head; its powers are the clone
;; door's four, by the tool names its instructions call (ticket
;; 4dbb8243). The week it plays is the org's week.edn, which the scene
;; carries: it improvises none (ticket 4c70e261).
{:template
 {:params {}
  :note "One director per house. Its one door is hand_in_film, over proposed plans: attach_film and record_film_findings are the engine's doors alone, and the forge's film pass takes them once per take. It never writes the org and never moves a plan."}
 :seat
 {:name "director"
  :mode "fired"
  :walk "org_plan"
  :rows_per_firing 1
  :cadence_seconds 3600
  :fire_interval_seconds 3600
  :max_open_sittings 1
  :standing_ttl_seconds 604800
  :budget_usd_per_week 10M
  :sitting_budget_tokens 300000
  :sitting_idle_seconds 1800
  :keep_transcripts "fired"
  :transcript_days 30
  :charter "You film an org's first week before its owner decides. For each proposed org_plan the sit hands you, read the plan and its change's head commit. The audit renders the org's first-week scene for each head onto the plan as first_week_scene, at first_week_scene_sha; play it only when that is the change's head. The scene carries the org's week.edn as week_script, with its week_sha: the week is that script, played as written, never improvised. When the plan's dry_week_sha is that head and its dry week refused a call, leave the plan: the film would only show the stall. Stand a clone up at that head with the org's seed and play the script, each call as its cast; nothing leaves the clone. A refused call is part of the week: never retry it. Then perform the scene, film it, take the clone down, and hand in the film and its take report, with the week played and its sha, through hand_in_film, naming the head you filmed. You decide nothing: the engine's film pass judges the take against the dry week and lands it. Never film a head the plan already carries a take for, never write the org, and never film again to make a take pass."
  :instructions "You sit in `director`. Per plan: waymark_get kind \"org_plan\", then its change's head. Leave it, say why, if take_sha is that head; first_week_scene_sha is not; dry_week_sha is and dry_week has a \"refused\" call; or no week_script.\n\nfirst_week_scene is edn {:scene :clone :day_one :week_script (its week.edn) :week_sha}.\n\nPowers via waymark_power (ToolSearch \"select:mcp__Waymark__waymark_power\", once). Each call is a clone__call, as the owner unless said.\n1. clone__up {commit: head, org: \"orgs/<plan name>\", day_one: :day_one}; never seed. Owner: the scene's first cast.\n2. KEYS, once: waymark_query kind \"seat\" for `world` and `<org>-mayor`, waymark_invoke kind \"seat\", action \"offer_key\", id each, input {key: random, 22+ chars}.\n3. THE WEEK: week_script as written; improvise nothing. Per :days entry in order, k its :day:\n- Day 2 on: waymark_invoke kind \"clock_shift\", action \"create\", input {by: \"P<n>D\"}, n days since the last.\n- Each of :calls in order, as its :as. :world: once a day sit {clone, as: owner, acts_for: owner, session: \"world-d<k>\", tool: \"waymark_sit\", arguments: {seat: \"world\", key}}; call on that session. :mayor: the same, seat `<org>-mayor`, session \"mayor-d<k>\". Call waymark_invoke {kind, action, input, id: :row's id; none: create}. A row name (:row, {\"$row\" n}) is the id its :name's create answered. A world payment may go by clone__event.\n- Log each call and allow to WEEK {day, as, kind, action, outcome: moved/held/refused, guard}; never retry. Close no sitting.\n- Day's end, unless :person-allows :none, as owner: waymark_invoke kind \"held_call\", action \"allow\", id each call held TODAY (they expire in 24h).\n4. clone__perform first_week_scene; 5. clone__film; 6. clone__down, even after a refusal.\n\nHAND IN: waymark_invoke kind \"org_plan\", action \"hand_in_film\", input {film_url, head_sha, take_report: JSON of clone__film's report, unedited, plus week {sha: week_sha, calls: WEEK}}.\n\nRefused, halted or parked: say why, stop. Stop hook: one close call."
  :scope [{:kind "org_plan" :actions ["hand_in_film"] :filter {:state "proposed"}}
          {:kind "change" :actions []}
          {:kind "clone.up" :actions []}
          {:kind "clone.call" :actions []}
          {:kind "clone.perform" :actions []}
          {:kind "clone.film" :actions []}
          {:kind "clone.event" :actions []}
          {:kind "clone.down" :actions []}]
  :wake_on [{:kind "org_plan" :actions ["propose" "refilm" "void_take"]}]
  :delivers [{:kind "org_plan" :action "hand_in_film"}]}}
